{"id":"agustina-hernandez","name":"Agustina Hernández Avilés","givenNames":"Agustina","surnames":["Hernández","Avilés"],"birth":{"date":"1705-08-27","place":"Fuentesaúco"},"baptism":{"date":"1705-09-06","note":"Iglesia de San Juan Bautista.","place":"Fuentesaúco","transcription":"Agustina Hernz Abilés.\n\nEn vte y siete de agosto de este año de setecientos y cinco nació Agustina, hija de Juº Hz y de Ysabel Avilés, sus padres lexítimos, y yo el infraescrito la baptizé y puse los santos óleos en seis de setiembre de dho año; fue su padrino Franco Azemilles, y la madrina no tocó la criatura; para cuya certificación lo firmé dho día del baptismo. Ldo Grego de Sandobal."},"father":"juan-hernandez","mother":"isabel-aviles","isDirectAncestor":true,"marriages":[{"spouse":"pedro-duran"}],"parentSummaries":[{"id":"juan-hernandez","name":"Juan Hernández","givenNames":"Juan","surnames":["Hernández"],"isDirectAncestor":true,"relation":"father"},{"id":"isabel-aviles","name":"Isabel Avilés","givenNames":"Isabel","surnames":["Avilés"],"isDirectAncestor":true,"relation":"mother"}],"children":[{"id":"catalina-duran-hernandez","name":"Catalina Durán Hernández","givenNames":"Catalina","surnames":["Durán","Hernández"],"isDirectAncestor":true,"father":"pedro-duran","mother":"agustina-hernandez"}],"partners":[{"id":"pedro-duran","name":"Pedro Durán Vivas","givenNames":"Pedro","surnames":["Durán","Vivas"],"isDirectAncestor":true,"sharedChildren":["catalina-duran-hernandez"]}]}
